cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use the Fragile-Operator Gap dataset or protocol in your work, please cite this repository.
title: "The Fragile‑Operator Gap: Assumption‑Extraction Protocol and Coded Taxonomy"
authors:
  - family-names: Youssef
    given-names: Michel
    affiliation: Midclear
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >
  This repository contains the five‑step assumption‑extraction protocol, the 49‑cell coded taxonomy, the framework corpus, and a validation subsample with second‑coder instructions.  The dataset supports open replicability for the study "The Fragile‑Operator Gap".  OSF and Zenodo DOIs are linked in the README.
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - zero trust
  - systematisation of knowledge
  - replicability
